{#
    JS texts of the control room (assets/controllers/online_control_controller.js): one JSON object, keys = what the JS
    asks for. Plain texts with |trans (their %placeholders% filled in the browser), plural texts with browser_translation()
    (chosen by translation_choice.js). A refused stopwatch action is shown as `refused_<code>` (the stopwatch's own
    RoundStopwatchRefusal texts) or `error_<code>`. Pinned by tests/OnlineRoundsTextsTest.php.
    With live video (video_console, stream VM) the console's texts follow (`video_*`, assets/online/console_video.js);
    without it the object is exactly the Phase 1 one.
#}
